      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The hamlet sits within Catskill Park, its rolling hills and Esopus Creek valley shaped by glacial deposits from the Wisconsin glaciation.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Olivebridge,_New_York",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1907‑1917, the Ashokan Dam and Reservoir flooded low‑lying areas, displacing parts of Olivebridge to supply about 40 % of New York City’s drinking water.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
